<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><i>Proposal No. 9. Approve, on an advisory basis, certain compensation
arrangements for ARCA named executive officers that are based on or otherwise relate to the Merger.</i></p>

